      "id": "issue-109-axum-core-generic-from-request-bound",
      "issue": 109,
      "reason": "The reference engine resolves T::from_request through a blanket trait impl by method/name matching without proving that the impl's predicates apply to the caller's type parameter. Issue 109 requires every impl predicate to be proven before a trait-impl UFCS answer may be Typed; the bound is unknown here, so the vendored engine correctly withholds the answer.",
